,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1158.799319826,"data":"  `ops(device)` is tinygrad's OWN per-program op estimate, summed over the\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1158.799325154,"data":"  schedule that actually ran (engine/realize.py:63, ast.arg.estimates).\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1158.799327935,"data":"  `alu_lane(cens)` is this repo's census of the same graph scheduled in\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1158.799330614,"data":"  isolation. Two different definitions of the same idea, and their ratio\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1158.799333344,"data":"  to each other is NOT 1 -- that is the non-additivity notes/31 §3.5\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1158.799337042,"data":"  warned about, now visible in one table instead of argued about.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1158.799339874,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1158.79934233,"data":"== does the offline census transfer to THIS device? ==\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1158.799344981,"data":"  `notes/31` priced these expressions with Context(DEV='CUDA') on a host\n"}
